  "referenceNumber": "IRN0283",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect that JAKKI is an involved person under The Iran (Sanctions) Regulations 2023 on the basis of the following ground: JAKKI is or has been involved in hostile activity by the Government of Iran through engaging in conduct which gives support or assistance to the activity of threatening, planning or conducting attacks against persons in a country other than Iran.  \n",
